    /// How much of the layer is mirrored, as a fraction of its CROPPED
    /// height.
    pub height: f64,
    /// Source pixels between the layer's bottom edge and the reflection.
    pub gap: f64,
    /// How fast the mirrored copy fades out: 0 does not fade at all, 1
